  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## Zoom & gestures\n\n**Trackpad wheel events are now aggregated into a single gesture.**\nWheel events are timestamped and grouped using a new `WheelGestureGap`, and the wheel\nanchor in `ReportView` is kept persistent for the duration of the gesture instead of\nbeing recomputed per event.\n\n**Sub-threshold pinch frames are deferred.**\n`GestureModel.PinchByStep` / `PinchByScale` now report whether the change actually\nreached the `ZoomModel`. Small frames are accumulated and only written once they exceed\n`ZoomStepThreshold`. This fixes the visual drift between the model zoom and the rendered\npages during slow pinches.\n\nAdded tests covering the accumulation behaviour and confirming that presenter and page\nlayout do not drift across many sub-threshold frames.\n\n## Internal\n\n- `InternalsVisibleTo` added for the WPF test assembly, enabling direct unit tests of\n  internal `Pysar.Wpf` logic without widening the public API.\n\n**Full changelog:** v0.1.53...HEAD",
